WEBVTT

01:38.110 --> 01:41.070
[The Demon Hunter's Romance]

01:41.090 --> 01:43.940
[Episode 20]

01:53.039 --> 01:53.759
Where am I?

01:55.120 --> 01:56.200
W-What are you guys up to?

01:56.200 --> 01:56.950
And who are you?

01:56.950 --> 01:57.750
Stop talking.

01:58.680 --> 01:59.539
Leave me alone.

02:10.750 --> 02:11.310
Sir?

02:13.400 --> 02:14.030
Sir,

02:15.070 --> 02:16.220
I-I'm hungry.

02:17.400 --> 02:19.650
Can you untie me

02:19.680 --> 02:21.280
and give me something to eat?

02:24.240 --> 02:24.800
Hey,

02:25.079 --> 02:26.560
don't be so silent.

02:28.710 --> 02:29.910
Just cut to the chase.

02:30.560 --> 02:32.940
Are you after my money or my looks?

02:33.430 --> 02:34.470
if you want money, we can talk.

02:34.470 --> 02:35.930
I'm from a wealthy family.

02:36.079 --> 02:37.290
We can talk about it.

02:39.190 --> 02:40.310
S-See?

02:40.470 --> 02:41.680
I'm just a weak girl.

02:42.060 --> 02:42.970
I can't escape

02:43.000 --> 02:44.460
now that you've caught me,

02:44.590 --> 02:46.500
but whatever you're planning,

02:47.180 --> 02:48.300
you can't let me

02:48.329 --> 02:49.530
starve to death, huh?

02:49.890 --> 02:50.630
Otherwise,

02:51.000 --> 02:51.800
you would end up

02:51.800 --> 02:53.290
getting nothing for it.

02:53.400 --> 02:54.800
Not a great deal, huh?

02:57.630 --> 02:58.630
Don't glare at me.

03:00.550 --> 03:01.150
Honestly,

03:01.310 --> 03:02.830
I haven't had anything to eat or drink

03:02.830 --> 03:04.220
since this morning.

03:05.000 --> 03:06.870
You don't know how much a girl has to go through

03:06.870 --> 03:07.820
for a wedding ceremony.

03:07.820 --> 03:08.640
You know what?

03:08.910 --> 03:10.310
When I woke up this morning,

03:10.310 --> 03:11.550
firstly, I had to wash up.

03:11.550 --> 03:12.780
After washing up,

03:12.960 --> 03:14.120
I had to get dressed up.

03:14.120 --> 03:15.720
After getting dressed up...

03:17.280 --> 03:18.470
Hey! Untie me!

03:26.910 --> 03:27.640
Big Brother!

03:28.120 --> 03:29.250
Where are you going?

03:29.640 --> 03:30.170
Oh no,

03:30.360 --> 03:31.420
Big Brother is mad.

03:36.190 --> 03:37.250
What are you doing?

03:37.690 --> 03:38.370
Listen,

03:38.400 --> 03:39.460
don't mess around!

03:39.800 --> 03:41.030
Do you know who I am?

03:46.780 --> 03:47.780
Where's that guy?

03:48.360 --> 03:50.000
You mean our Big Brother?

03:52.880 --> 03:53.940
Aren't you hungry?

03:54.370 --> 03:55.000
Damao probably

03:55.000 --> 03:56.400
went to buy you some food.

03:56.930 --> 03:58.060
So his name is Damao?

03:58.360 --> 03:58.910
Yes.

04:00.120 --> 04:01.030
Didn't he tell you

04:01.030 --> 04:01.870
his name?

04:03.680 --> 04:05.370
Y-You don't even know

04:05.400 --> 04:07.120
h-his name?

04:07.360 --> 04:08.750
How am I supposed to know that?

04:08.750 --> 04:11.150
Because he likes you!

04:12.290 --> 04:13.090
The other day,

04:13.290 --> 04:14.610
he headed south first,

04:14.630 --> 04:15.710
then north,

04:15.800 --> 04:16.920
and then he met you.

04:16.940 --> 04:18.510
he fell in love with you.

04:19.560 --> 04:20.589
Fell for me?

04:20.800 --> 04:21.390
Yes.

04:21.630 --> 04:22.830
Didn't you know that?

04:23.920 --> 04:25.070
No, I didn't!

04:25.630 --> 04:26.120
Oh no.

04:26.310 --> 04:26.630
Oh no.

04:26.630 --> 04:27.690
Oh, our Big Brother.

04:27.690 --> 04:29.180
He's such a poor thing.

04:29.390 --> 04:30.160
It was all for nothing.

04:30.160 --> 04:32.090
So Big Brother is one... one-sided...

04:32.090 --> 04:33.070
Shut up.

04:36.270 --> 04:37.159
All of you, be quiet.

04:37.159 --> 04:37.800
You speak.

04:41.070 --> 04:42.750
What else is there to say?

04:43.120 --> 04:44.950
When our Big Brother ran into you,

04:44.950 --> 04:46.310
he fell in love with you.

04:46.750 --> 04:48.070
He didn't want you to marry someone else.

04:48.070 --> 04:49.720
So we came to snatch the bride!

04:49.720 --> 04:50.280
So,

04:50.620 --> 04:52.090
you are now our

04:52.120 --> 04:53.070
sister-in-law!

04:55.000 --> 04:55.930
Sister-in-law!

04:58.870 --> 04:59.560
Really?

04:59.990 --> 05:00.880
For sure!

05:04.800 --> 05:05.660
Stop laughing.

05:05.750 --> 05:06.150
Get up.

05:06.250 --> 05:07.380
Big Brother is back.

05:11.310 --> 05:12.630
Just something simple.

05:12.630 --> 05:13.490
Make do with it.

05:14.270 --> 05:15.100
These snacks...

05:15.100 --> 05:16.240
Hey, don't be rude.

05:16.270 --> 05:17.200
Line up, line up.

05:18.120 --> 05:18.850
Big Brother,

05:18.950 --> 05:20.950
I'll distribute the snacks to them.

05:21.000 --> 05:22.060
Let's go, let's go.

05:22.360 --> 05:24.290
We'll leave you to it, Big Brother.

05:25.870 --> 05:27.000
If you don't untie my hands,

05:27.000 --> 05:28.330
how am I supposed to eat?

05:37.430 --> 05:38.760
Don't you want some too?

05:39.190 --> 05:40.050
I'm not hungry.

05:42.040 --> 05:43.130
Are there

05:43.159 --> 05:44.890
only four of you in your family?

05:45.190 --> 05:46.120
Are your parents

05:46.120 --> 05:47.250
still in Guangping?

05:51.600 --> 05:53.000
Don't bother asking me anything

05:53.000 --> 05:54.830
or trying to probe for information.

05:54.830 --> 05:55.900
I won't hurt you.

05:56.900 --> 05:58.390
I'm just still not sure

05:58.830 --> 05:59.750
how exactly

05:59.750 --> 06:00.680
to explain

06:00.680 --> 06:01.800
everything to you.

06:02.630 --> 06:03.810
Let me think about it.

06:03.810 --> 06:05.610
I'll tell you when I've decided.

06:09.430 --> 06:10.680
Now that I look at you,

06:11.830 --> 06:13.600
you're indeed way more handsome than your

06:13.600 --> 06:15.000
three younger brothers.

06:19.900 --> 06:20.870
Come on...

06:22.600 --> 06:23.430
Your brothers

06:23.430 --> 06:24.750
have told me everything.

06:24.750 --> 06:26.440
You kidnapped me at my wedding

06:26.460 --> 06:27.950
because you fell for me.

06:29.720 --> 06:30.630
When did you

06:30.630 --> 06:31.360
run into me?

06:32.630 --> 06:34.040
Was it in Guangping?

06:34.560 --> 06:36.040
Why don't I remember?

06:37.870 --> 06:38.870
That makes sense.

06:39.600 --> 06:40.360
I have always

06:40.800 --> 06:42.530
been popular since I was young.

06:43.000 --> 06:44.870
But you came too late.

06:46.480 --> 06:47.920
My husband, you know,

06:47.950 --> 06:49.240
works in the government office.

06:49.240 --> 06:49.920
Given the way

06:49.920 --> 06:51.870
you kidnapped me in broad daylight,

06:51.870 --> 06:53.240
you'll be convicted of a felony.

06:53.240 --> 06:54.100
How about this?

06:54.630 --> 06:55.870
If you let me go now,

06:56.120 --> 06:56.920
I'll go back

06:56.920 --> 06:58.240
and put in a good word for you,

06:58.240 --> 06:59.770
asking him to go easy on you.

07:02.070 --> 07:03.200
You're still young.

07:03.720 --> 07:04.870
You don't understand that

07:04.870 --> 07:06.270
love can't come by

07:06.270 --> 07:07.870
through force.

07:08.030 --> 07:08.830
Just take it as

07:09.160 --> 07:10.890
we're not meant for each other,

07:11.330 --> 07:11.830
okay?

07:27.600 --> 07:28.630
Have you heard that?

07:28.630 --> 07:29.830
Lord Huang was getting married today.

07:29.830 --> 07:31.680
But a sedan chair bearer took the bride away.

07:31.680 --> 07:32.680
There are officials and servants

07:32.680 --> 07:33.920
from Huang's Residence searching everywhere.

07:33.920 --> 07:35.580
It's hard not to hear about it.

07:36.560 --> 07:37.960
She eloped with a bearer.

07:38.390 --> 07:39.190
The neighbors

07:39.270 --> 07:41.000
will have much to gossip about.

07:41.159 --> 07:41.920
Indeed!

07:41.920 --> 07:44.380
County Commandant Huang has been famous...

07:45.000 --> 07:46.000
Who did this?

07:47.190 --> 07:47.750
Who?

07:48.740 --> 07:49.300
My Lord.

07:50.850 --> 07:51.720
Keep it quiet.

07:52.720 --> 07:53.850
Greetings, My Lord.

07:54.390 --> 07:55.450
I've sent all our men

07:55.450 --> 07:56.240
to go all out.

07:56.390 --> 07:56.870
I believe

07:56.870 --> 07:58.870
we'll catch those scoundrels soon.

07:59.240 --> 08:00.600
The scoundrels can wait.

08:00.600 --> 08:01.160
The first priority now

08:01.160 --> 08:02.310
is to rescue my wife.

08:02.890 --> 08:03.750
When it's done,

08:03.830 --> 08:05.350
hope you'll keep your word, My Lord,

08:05.350 --> 08:06.320
and be lenient

08:06.510 --> 08:07.180
with our men in jail.

08:07.180 --> 08:07.950
Sure, sure.

08:08.680 --> 08:10.000
Murderers must pay with their lives,

08:10.000 --> 08:11.510
but I'll go easy with the rest.

08:11.510 --> 08:12.190
It's a deal.

08:12.760 --> 08:13.690
Spread the word.

08:13.890 --> 08:15.070
Whoever rescues her

08:15.270 --> 08:17.870
will receive an extra generous reward from me.

08:18.270 --> 08:18.600
Understood.

08:18.600 --> 08:19.040
Alright, alright.

08:19.040 --> 08:21.370
-Please await good news, My Lord.
-Go, go.

08:25.480 --> 08:26.340
Come on, hurry!

08:27.120 --> 08:27.780
Over there!

08:28.160 --> 08:28.490
Okay.

08:28.680 --> 08:30.210
-You go that way.
-Yes, sir!

08:31.160 --> 08:32.620
-And you go that way!
-Yes!

08:35.600 --> 08:36.750
My hands hurt.

08:38.030 --> 08:39.590
What's wrong with your hands?

08:39.590 --> 08:41.350
I've been tied up for so long.

08:42.080 --> 08:43.669
My hands now feel

08:43.669 --> 08:44.790
completely numb.

08:45.360 --> 08:46.620
I can't even move them.

08:47.350 --> 08:48.210
How about this?

08:48.240 --> 08:49.160
Can you kindly

08:49.480 --> 08:51.270
loosen the ropes a bit?

08:53.600 --> 08:54.440
Do you think

08:55.150 --> 08:56.440
I can trust you?

08:58.120 --> 08:59.360
Fine, fine.

08:59.550 --> 09:01.350
Then can you at least change my posture?

09:01.350 --> 09:02.320
Like, tie my hands in the front?

09:02.320 --> 09:03.850
That should be okay, right?

09:23.960 --> 09:24.720
Bro,

09:24.960 --> 09:27.160
I'm the lady from a martial arts school.

09:28.510 --> 09:29.080
You really are...

09:29.080 --> 09:29.790
What?

09:30.320 --> 09:31.710
You let your guard down.

09:32.200 --> 09:33.030
Besides,

09:33.050 --> 09:34.670
didn't you say you liked me?

09:35.000 --> 09:36.670
You don't even know I can do martial arts,

09:36.670 --> 09:37.950
yet you claim to like me?

09:37.950 --> 09:38.760
Nonsense!

09:40.600 --> 09:41.150
Stop!

09:45.080 --> 09:45.510
I...

09:45.720 --> 09:46.970
Are you crazy?

09:47.000 --> 09:48.200
Big Brother, I...

09:48.720 --> 09:50.000
Are you nuts too?

09:50.030 --> 09:50.480
I...

09:52.480 --> 09:53.210
Are you okay?

09:58.530 --> 09:59.870
J-Just one hit,

09:59.870 --> 10:00.960
and you're bleeding?

10:00.960 --> 10:01.810
Behave yourself!

10:01.810 --> 10:03.140
Don't bother saving me.

10:06.910 --> 10:07.970
What are you doing?

10:08.270 --> 10:09.350
My bros!

10:09.510 --> 10:09.910
I...

10:11.560 --> 10:12.290
Big Brother.

10:14.390 --> 10:14.940
It's her,

10:15.200 --> 10:15.890
Miss He.

10:16.630 --> 10:17.200
It's her.

10:18.080 --> 10:19.870
My Lady, please don't be nervous.

10:19.870 --> 10:20.550
County Commandant Huang

10:20.550 --> 10:21.610
sent us to find you.

10:21.870 --> 10:23.750
I've already let someone go inform him.

10:23.750 --> 10:24.480
Soon enough,

10:24.500 --> 10:25.150
Lord Huang will

10:25.150 --> 10:26.430
come to take you back in person.

10:26.430 --> 10:27.690
No need to wait for him.

10:27.690 --> 10:28.620
I'll go back now.

10:28.680 --> 10:29.480
No, you can't!

10:31.830 --> 10:33.230
She's not going anywhere

10:33.390 --> 10:34.000
unless

10:34.080 --> 10:35.010
you knock me out.

10:36.390 --> 10:37.720
Who do you think you are?

10:38.960 --> 10:40.270
I don't even need to ask.

10:40.270 --> 10:42.870
You must be the one who took the bride away, huh?

10:43.320 --> 10:44.080
You must

10:44.080 --> 10:45.080
be crazy.

10:45.240 --> 10:46.550
How dare you try to snatch a woman

10:46.550 --> 10:47.390
from Commandant Huang?

10:47.390 --> 10:49.250
You're insulting my Big Brother?

10:51.600 --> 10:53.130
I'll fight you to the death!

11:35.150 --> 11:35.810
Beat him up!

11:37.460 --> 11:37.980
Hit him!

11:46.200 --> 11:46.930
Big Brother!

11:58.320 --> 11:59.180
Stop fighting!

11:59.270 --> 12:00.200
I'll go with you.

12:01.480 --> 12:02.680
You little hooligan,

12:03.080 --> 12:04.440
you've got some nerve!

12:05.320 --> 12:07.720
Unless you beat me to death today,

12:08.510 --> 12:09.240
don't even

12:09.390 --> 12:10.990
think about taking her away!

12:11.010 --> 12:12.060
Are you stupid or what?

12:12.060 --> 12:13.660
What if they really kill you?

12:16.030 --> 12:16.670
Good.

12:17.200 --> 12:18.730
I'm impressed by your guts.

12:19.680 --> 12:21.140
I'll grant your wish then.

12:53.550 --> 12:54.510
What are you waiting for?

12:54.510 --> 12:55.150
Hurry and run!

12:55.150 --> 12:55.610
Come on!

12:56.960 --> 12:57.630
Hurry up!

13:07.260 --> 13:07.840
My Lord.

13:08.960 --> 13:09.490
Bad news.

13:09.510 --> 13:10.550
Miss He and the bearer

13:10.550 --> 13:11.440
have run to the west.

13:11.440 --> 13:11.870
What?

13:12.840 --> 13:13.300
My Lord,

13:13.720 --> 13:14.920
I just heard about it.

13:15.200 --> 13:16.230
The people there claimed

13:16.230 --> 13:17.760
to see Miss He and the bearer

13:18.000 --> 13:19.460
running towards the west.

13:32.200 --> 13:33.200
Man, you've got

13:33.320 --> 13:34.030
neither strength

13:34.030 --> 13:34.890
to do anything,

13:34.910 --> 13:35.440
nor power or status,

13:35.440 --> 13:37.000
and you're even taking care of three dumb brothers.

13:37.000 --> 13:39.390
Why on earth did you take me away from the wedding?

13:39.390 --> 13:41.270
I know I'm quite irresistible,

13:41.750 --> 13:42.760
but as a healthy man,

13:42.760 --> 13:44.200
you will find someone to marry.

13:44.200 --> 13:45.000
Why do you have to

13:45.000 --> 13:46.030
stick to me?

13:46.290 --> 13:47.320
If I hadn't saved you just now,

13:47.320 --> 13:48.580
you'd be dead already.

13:56.960 --> 13:58.960
See the blood on this handkerchief?

14:00.320 --> 14:01.120
Yes.

14:02.080 --> 14:03.010
What color is it?

14:04.000 --> 14:04.790
Red.

14:05.410 --> 14:06.200
Then, what color

14:06.200 --> 14:07.380
was the blood of the people

14:07.380 --> 14:09.040
who were fighting us just now?

14:09.150 --> 14:10.480
Are you messing with me?

14:10.910 --> 14:12.320
I'm asking you what color it was.

14:12.320 --> 14:13.920
It must all be red, of course.

14:15.870 --> 14:17.600
Can't you tell the difference?

14:21.240 --> 14:22.570
Then why did you help me?

14:23.550 --> 14:24.150
I have no idea

14:24.150 --> 14:25.240
why I helped you!

14:25.840 --> 14:26.630
Maybe just like you,

14:26.630 --> 14:28.290
my brain's not working right.

14:28.440 --> 14:30.390
When those people go back to report,

14:30.390 --> 14:31.030
and my father finds out,

14:31.030 --> 14:33.030
he'll definitely teach me a lesson.

14:36.080 --> 14:37.610
And you're still laughing?

14:38.600 --> 14:39.720
Don't be afraid.

14:40.390 --> 14:41.630
Everything will be fine

14:41.630 --> 14:43.090
when you wake up tomorrow.

14:43.630 --> 14:45.490
I don't understand what you mean.

14:45.920 --> 14:47.280
Anyway, I'm already engaged.

14:47.280 --> 14:48.270
No matter how much you love me,

14:48.270 --> 14:49.670
I just won't fall for you!

14:50.000 --> 14:51.060
I'm going home now.

14:54.520 --> 14:55.310
Huang?

15:02.540 --> 15:04.030
So the rumor is true.

15:05.650 --> 15:07.850
You really have an affair with someone.

15:11.750 --> 15:13.210
How could you do this to me?

15:15.910 --> 15:17.720
I'm going to kill him right now!

15:21.760 --> 15:23.090
Why are you helping him?

15:23.840 --> 15:24.370
Wait, no.

15:24.480 --> 15:25.290
Let me explain.

15:25.290 --> 15:26.270
Enough!

15:27.120 --> 15:27.910
He Quelian.

15:30.360 --> 15:31.600
We grew up together

15:32.430 --> 15:33.960
as childhood sweethearts.

15:35.010 --> 15:36.050
I gave you

15:36.550 --> 15:37.950
my whole heart

15:37.970 --> 15:38.930
long ago.

15:39.320 --> 15:40.780
How could you do this to me?

15:41.710 --> 15:42.240
You...

15:43.910 --> 15:44.750
You...

15:45.840 --> 15:47.320
You heartless woman!

15:48.510 --> 15:49.270
I'm going to

15:49.270 --> 15:50.360
kill you right now!

15:57.020 --> 15:58.480
You fell on your own, okay?

16:00.040 --> 16:01.100
Let's go, let's go.

16:04.440 --> 16:06.080
Is my face messed up?

16:08.620 --> 16:09.720
They're over there! Get them!

16:09.720 --> 16:10.310
Search carefully.

16:10.310 --> 16:10.970
Stop there!

16:11.860 --> 16:13.270
I'm over here.

16:19.910 --> 16:20.710
Go after them!

16:27.790 --> 16:29.150
We're safe now. We're safe.

16:29.150 --> 16:29.910
Let's get out of here.

16:29.910 --> 16:30.910
Oh, no.

16:32.840 --> 16:34.080
Now there's no way

16:34.080 --> 16:35.790
to clear my name.

16:36.360 --> 16:37.510
Then don't try to clear it.

16:37.510 --> 16:38.240
Let's go now.

16:38.440 --> 16:40.000
What do you mean by "let's go"?

16:40.000 --> 16:41.240
Hey, you...

16:41.270 --> 16:43.320
Do you understand social etiquette at all?

16:43.320 --> 16:44.480
I've brought disgrace

16:44.480 --> 16:45.480
to my family now.

16:45.640 --> 16:46.670
Your romantic escapades

16:46.670 --> 16:48.800
can't overcome everything, can they?

16:49.030 --> 16:50.750
Besides, I don't even love you.

16:50.750 --> 16:52.550
I just knew you not long ago!

16:53.150 --> 16:54.600
You took a brick attack for me,

16:54.600 --> 16:55.750
I'm touched.

16:55.870 --> 16:56.670
But today is

16:56.670 --> 16:57.670
my wedding day.

16:57.790 --> 16:59.120
If you really like me,

16:59.120 --> 17:01.180
you shouldn't have hurt me like this.

17:02.670 --> 17:03.470
Are you angry?

17:03.750 --> 17:05.190
Isn't it obvious?

17:09.240 --> 17:10.300
You like Youhuang?

17:10.930 --> 17:12.000
Who is Youhuang?

17:13.810 --> 17:15.410
The man who just got injured.

17:16.589 --> 17:18.000
That's my husband!

17:19.359 --> 17:20.400
So you like him?

17:28.440 --> 17:30.370
I don't even want to explain to you.

17:31.960 --> 17:33.400
If I say I'll go back with you

17:33.400 --> 17:34.800
and explain everything,

17:35.510 --> 17:36.910
will you feel any better?

17:40.000 --> 17:41.400
But I have one condition.

17:43.880 --> 17:45.680
Spend the rest of the day with me.

17:46.750 --> 17:48.480
What kind of condition is that?

17:48.920 --> 17:49.800
It's simple.

17:49.960 --> 17:50.960
Just stay with me.

17:51.020 --> 17:51.550
I'll take you back

17:51.550 --> 17:52.480
right at 9 PM

17:52.790 --> 17:53.680
and explain everything

17:53.680 --> 17:55.000
in detail.

17:55.400 --> 17:56.860
I'll be at your mercy then.

17:58.350 --> 17:58.920
You...

18:01.310 --> 18:02.750
Spend a day with you?

18:04.240 --> 18:04.920
Well then,

18:05.790 --> 18:06.920
what would we do?

18:07.960 --> 18:08.920
Don't worry.

18:09.610 --> 18:10.610
I won't force you

18:10.640 --> 18:12.500
to do anything against your will.

18:12.720 --> 18:13.750
Just hang around

18:14.030 --> 18:15.750
with me casually.

18:21.160 --> 18:22.110
Are you serious?

18:23.070 --> 18:23.800
I am serious.

18:26.200 --> 18:27.270
You do realize that

18:27.920 --> 18:29.120
if you go back with me,

18:29.680 --> 18:32.150
you'll be jailed and beaten, right?

18:34.790 --> 18:35.590
Moreover,

18:35.920 --> 18:36.750
Huang

18:37.000 --> 18:38.730
works in the government office.

18:38.730 --> 18:39.310
You brought him

18:39.310 --> 18:40.570
great shame this time.

18:41.030 --> 18:42.310
Once you enter there,

18:42.440 --> 18:44.310
your fate will be no longer yours to decide.

18:44.310 --> 18:45.240
I know.

18:46.000 --> 18:46.830
A gentleman

18:46.830 --> 18:48.360
never goes back on his word.

18:48.720 --> 18:49.030
Wait,

18:49.030 --> 18:49.640
what's the point

18:49.640 --> 18:51.370
of all this mess you're making?

18:52.000 --> 18:52.930
As I've told you,

18:53.550 --> 18:55.550
I just want you to spend a day with me.

18:56.590 --> 18:58.120
You're sacrificing so much

18:59.400 --> 19:01.200
just to have me with you for a day?

19:03.240 --> 19:04.970
You can understand it this way.

19:06.960 --> 19:08.880
You're so in love with me.

19:15.750 --> 19:16.310
Deal!

19:18.790 --> 19:19.410
I'll stay with you!

19:19.410 --> 19:20.340
You have my word!

19:21.240 --> 19:22.100
Let's hang out!

19:23.880 --> 19:25.880
Then come with me.

19:27.200 --> 19:27.730
Alright.

19:32.550 --> 19:33.640
Bye, and hope to see you again,

19:33.640 --> 19:34.440
sir and madam.

19:35.160 --> 19:35.690
Let's go.

19:39.640 --> 19:40.570
Enjoy your meal.

19:41.110 --> 19:41.910
Sir and Madam,

19:41.950 --> 19:42.950
this way, please.

19:43.200 --> 19:45.000
Come on, let me fill it up for you.

19:46.030 --> 19:46.790
Come on.

19:46.960 --> 19:48.620
What would you two like to eat?

19:48.790 --> 19:49.400
Anything is fine.

19:49.400 --> 19:50.450
Any interesting news lately?

19:50.450 --> 19:51.200
Tell us about it.

19:51.200 --> 19:52.440
Haven't you heard about

19:52.440 --> 19:54.000
the big incident that happened today?

19:54.000 --> 19:54.860
What happened?

19:54.920 --> 19:56.550
The county commandant's bride

19:56.550 --> 19:57.830
was taken away by a bearer.

19:57.830 --> 19:58.510
Really?

19:59.070 --> 19:59.800
Tell us more.

19:59.880 --> 20:01.080
You two didn't see it.

20:01.350 --> 20:02.070
That bearer

20:02.200 --> 20:03.730
ran off carrying the bride.

20:04.500 --> 20:05.110
This sounds

20:05.110 --> 20:06.100
much more interesting than

20:06.100 --> 20:07.310
the Six Wonders of Guangping.

20:07.310 --> 20:08.070
Right?

20:08.240 --> 20:08.920
That's fun.

20:09.160 --> 20:10.350
Six Wonders of Guangping?

20:10.350 --> 20:11.320
Look up.

20:11.350 --> 20:12.210
Open your eyes.

20:12.400 --> 20:14.510
The Six Wonders of Guangping are magnificent.

20:14.510 --> 20:15.390
The grand mountains,

20:15.390 --> 20:16.550
the gorgeous blossoms.

20:16.550 --> 20:19.160
The century-old pride and grace peak at the present.

20:19.160 --> 20:20.240
Who unlucky.

20:20.240 --> 20:21.440
Crossing paths with a funeral procession

20:21.440 --> 20:23.110
on his wedding day.

20:24.030 --> 20:25.310
It is unusual.

20:26.000 --> 20:27.240
Maybe it'll become an anecdote

20:27.240 --> 20:30.300
as famous as the Six Wonders of Guangping in the future.

20:31.450 --> 20:33.110
Who are you calling a pervert?

20:33.550 --> 20:34.590
What's wrong with you?

20:34.590 --> 20:35.790
What's your problem?

20:36.010 --> 20:36.850
Sorry, sorry.

20:36.880 --> 20:37.480
I'm sorry.

20:37.720 --> 20:38.400
Easy, easy.

20:38.400 --> 20:39.590
What is wrong with her?

20:39.590 --> 20:40.200
Calm down.

20:40.400 --> 20:41.130
Sit down now.

20:42.160 --> 20:42.880
I'm sorry.

20:45.920 --> 20:47.050
It's all your fault.

20:48.000 --> 20:49.130
Yeah, it's my fault.

20:49.480 --> 20:50.880
Enjoy your meal, please.

20:51.880 --> 20:53.740
Where are we going after the meal?

20:55.160 --> 20:57.760
Do you know about the Six Wonders of Guangping?

20:58.680 --> 20:59.210
Yes, I do.

21:00.680 --> 21:01.480
What are they?

21:03.090 --> 21:04.640
The Panorama from atop Shinan Tower,

21:04.640 --> 21:05.850
the Spring Scenery at Tang Garden,

21:05.850 --> 21:07.680
the Sogdian Whirl Dance with Aroma,

21:07.680 --> 21:09.030
the Fair at Flower Festival,

21:09.030 --> 21:10.640
the Night Banquet at South Lake,

21:10.640 --> 21:12.570
and the Ancient Matchmaking Tree.

21:13.640 --> 21:15.040
How do you know all these?

21:17.110 --> 21:18.640
They're well-known to all.

21:18.880 --> 21:20.070
Everyone in Guangping knows them,

21:20.070 --> 21:20.870
yet you don't?

21:22.960 --> 21:25.160
What's the Night Banquet at South Lake?

21:25.350 --> 21:27.700
A banquet hosted by Lord Xin'an for those scholars

21:27.700 --> 21:29.290
from humble backgrounds.

21:30.200 --> 21:31.000
When is it?

21:31.390 --> 21:32.790
It's being held tonight.

21:34.570 --> 21:35.640
How did you know what's going to

21:35.640 --> 21:36.570
happen tonight?

21:37.440 --> 21:39.370
Or you knew it when you were little?

21:43.240 --> 21:43.790
I...

21:48.070 --> 21:49.000
Time is ticking.

21:49.130 --> 21:49.750
Eat up now.

21:54.640 --> 21:55.970
I still can't figure out

21:56.820 --> 21:57.890
why I knew that the Night Banquet

21:57.890 --> 21:59.750
at South Lake would happen today.

22:00.160 --> 22:00.920
Tell me

22:01.350 --> 22:02.480
what day it is today.

22:03.680 --> 22:05.680
Today is an auspicious day.

22:07.350 --> 22:07.920
Yes,

22:08.590 --> 22:10.110
today is your wedding day.

22:10.270 --> 22:12.130
Of course it's an auspicious day.

22:12.690 --> 22:13.980
But you don't remember

22:14.070 --> 22:15.310
the exact date today.

22:19.200 --> 22:20.590
No need to rack your brain.

22:20.590 --> 22:22.120
You can't recall it anyway.

22:22.510 --> 22:23.570
Because this place

22:23.590 --> 22:25.590
doesn't have specific dates at all.

22:26.590 --> 22:28.850
The Six Wonders of Guangping are famous,

22:28.980 --> 22:29.810
but actually,

22:30.190 --> 22:31.160
they didn't even exist

22:31.160 --> 22:32.120
in the same era.

22:33.070 --> 22:34.110
The Night Banquet at South Lake

22:34.110 --> 22:35.660
was in the 2nd year of Tianxiang Era.

22:35.660 --> 22:37.160
And Shen Yingniang of the Sogdian Whirl Dance with Aroma

22:37.160 --> 22:39.020
was from over a hundred years ago.

22:39.310 --> 22:40.510
And that Shinan Tower

22:40.750 --> 22:42.810
was destroyed in a wildfire long ago.

22:43.160 --> 22:45.360
I don't understand what you're saying.

22:46.790 --> 22:47.440
In short,

22:47.880 --> 22:49.680
my Guangping and your Guangping

22:50.200 --> 22:51.060
are different.

22:55.720 --> 22:56.240
Alright,

22:56.240 --> 22:57.370
let's go take a look.

22:57.640 --> 22:59.240
We might get an answer there.

23:03.610 --> 23:04.400
Didn't you say this place

23:04.400 --> 23:06.000
was destroyed in a wildfire?

23:06.200 --> 23:07.200
Where's the fire?

23:13.480 --> 23:14.850
Why do you have to

23:14.870 --> 23:15.710
come up here?

23:18.460 --> 23:20.460
The air up here is quite refreshing.

23:21.510 --> 23:23.270
And the scenery is amazing too.

23:25.890 --> 23:27.640
Why don't you recite a poem?

23:27.980 --> 23:28.720
Other men

23:28.720 --> 23:29.920
usually recite a poem

23:30.040 --> 23:31.170
at moments like this

23:31.200 --> 23:33.330
to show off their talents, don't they?

23:38.240 --> 23:38.960
Hey, wait.

23:39.110 --> 23:40.440
Where is he going again?

23:49.750 --> 23:50.680
Are you alright?

23:54.240 --> 23:54.770
I'm fine.

23:55.200 --> 23:55.800
It's okay.

23:56.210 --> 23:56.670
Come on.

24:09.960 --> 24:11.760
What was wrong with you just now?

24:12.880 --> 24:13.880
What do you mean?

24:14.250 --> 24:15.440
You think I didn't see it?

24:15.440 --> 24:16.900
Did you do that on purpose?

24:17.910 --> 24:19.310
No, that was an accident.

24:19.750 --> 24:21.150
Are you lying to me again?

24:23.480 --> 24:24.310
And what did you come

24:24.310 --> 24:24.980
here for again?

24:24.980 --> 24:30.600
[Tang Garden]

24:26.110 --> 24:27.200
Among the Six Wonders of Guangping,

24:27.200 --> 24:28.480
didn't we already visit

24:28.480 --> 24:29.500
the Panorama from atop Shinan Tower?

24:29.500 --> 24:32.430
This Spring Scenery at Tang Garden is the second spot.

24:32.430 --> 24:33.080
They say

24:33.110 --> 24:34.420
the Second Young Master of the Tang family

24:34.420 --> 24:35.750
is a flower enthusiast,

24:35.750 --> 24:37.350
especially fond of peonies.

24:37.400 --> 24:39.590
The peonies inside abound in varieties,

24:39.590 --> 24:41.430
and they are of excellent quality

24:41.430 --> 24:42.690
and rosy glow.

24:44.070 --> 24:45.930
What? Do you want to go in here too?

24:46.960 --> 24:47.620
No, I guess.

24:48.110 --> 24:49.100
Young Master Tang,

24:49.100 --> 24:50.030
he's right here.

24:53.950 --> 24:54.640
Did

24:54.820 --> 24:55.790
you two claim to have a

24:55.790 --> 24:57.790
premium Zilonghuai to sell to me?

24:59.460 --> 24:59.980
No.

25:02.410 --> 25:03.320
Man...

25:03.510 --> 25:04.460
You clearly said that

25:04.460 --> 25:05.790
you had a flower to sell.

25:08.050 --> 25:08.640
You two,

25:09.280 --> 25:10.850
are you making fun of me?

25:12.050 --> 25:14.680
Yes, we are.

25:15.270 --> 25:15.880
Pardon?

25:19.030 --> 25:19.570
Young Master!

25:19.570 --> 25:20.160
Young Master!

25:20.160 --> 25:21.550
-Are you alright?
-Blood!

25:21.550 --> 25:22.590
How dare you hit me?

25:22.590 --> 25:23.070
You...

25:23.480 --> 25:24.240
Guards!

25:24.240 --> 25:25.030
Run, run, run!

25:25.030 --> 25:25.720
Anybody?

25:25.740 --> 25:26.720
Go call for help!

25:26.830 --> 25:27.850
Guards! Guards! Guards!

25:27.850 --> 25:29.850
Catch them and bring them back to me!

25:33.600 --> 25:34.550
They're up ahead! Get them!

25:34.550 --> 25:34.960
Yes!

25:41.640 --> 25:42.440
What's wrong?

25:42.960 --> 25:43.790
You're asking me that?

25:43.790 --> 25:44.900
I should be asking you!

25:44.900 --> 25:46.430
What on earth are you doing?

25:47.350 --> 25:48.830
No matter what crazy things you're up to,

25:48.830 --> 25:49.790
I'm done playing along.

25:49.790 --> 25:50.650
I'm going home.

25:50.960 --> 25:52.240
I suddenly find the land

25:52.240 --> 25:53.110
in front of your house

25:53.110 --> 25:54.750
a good spot with brilliant feng shui.

25:54.750 --> 25:55.550
If I

25:55.550 --> 25:56.580
smash my head and die there,

25:56.580 --> 25:58.240
my ghost can often see you come and go.

25:58.240 --> 25:58.960
That would be

25:58.960 --> 26:00.560
fulfilling one of my wishes.

26:01.790 --> 26:03.120
Are you threatening me?

26:04.640 --> 26:05.750
Didn't you promise

26:05.750 --> 26:07.250
to keep me company for a day?

26:07.250 --> 26:08.910
You can't go back on your word.

26:11.550 --> 26:13.160
But I agreed to hang around with you,

26:13.160 --> 26:14.540
not to bully others

26:14.790 --> 26:15.590
with you.

26:15.680 --> 26:16.830
Then I promise you

26:17.270 --> 26:18.930
I won't act recklessly again.

26:18.990 --> 26:20.450
Neither will I hit anyone.

26:23.030 --> 26:25.030
I-I had no choice.

26:25.240 --> 26:25.720
If I

26:25.830 --> 26:27.030
go back with you today,

26:27.030 --> 26:27.640
I might very well

26:27.640 --> 26:28.680
end up in jail.

26:29.240 --> 26:30.640
Those two people held a grudge against me.

26:30.640 --> 26:31.510
If I didn't take this chance

26:31.510 --> 26:32.640
to settle the score,

26:33.030 --> 26:35.960
I'm afraid I wouldn't rest in peace even after death.

26:37.830 --> 26:39.510
Death? What are you talking about?

26:39.510 --> 26:41.110
For this little trouble you've caused,

26:41.110 --> 26:42.580
at most you'll get a few lashes

26:42.580 --> 26:43.640
and be jailed for a few days.

26:43.640 --> 26:45.040
Then you'll be released.

26:47.400 --> 26:48.000
But

26:48.000 --> 26:48.960
you pushed someone

26:48.960 --> 26:49.880
and punched someone,

26:49.880 --> 26:51.080
what grudge was that?

26:56.750 --> 26:57.880
It's getting late.

26:58.030 --> 26:59.590
Let's continue to walk around.

26:59.590 --> 27:00.820
Didn't you promise

27:00.840 --> 27:01.680
to spend the day with me?

27:01.680 --> 27:02.720
Stop!

27:02.720 --> 27:04.400
I-I didn't!

27:05.880 --> 27:06.970
I'll take you somewhere.

27:06.970 --> 27:08.900
I don't want to go with you anymore.

27:09.400 --> 27:10.030
Sir and Madam,

27:10.030 --> 27:11.160
your dishes are all served.

27:11.160 --> 27:11.960
Please enjoy.

27:15.590 --> 27:17.750
Using the money from selling my jewelry

27:17.750 --> 27:19.070
to come and watch dancers,

27:19.070 --> 27:20.400
how generous you are.

27:21.830 --> 27:23.320
I'll pay you back tomorrow.

27:23.320 --> 27:24.450
You pay me back? How?

27:26.880 --> 27:31.270
Bravo!

27:31.830 --> 27:35.510
Bravo!

28:21.720 --> 28:22.590
I have a name!

28:23.370 --> 28:24.280
I'm Xuanye.

28:24.420 --> 28:25.960
I don't care about your name!

28:25.960 --> 28:26.510
Don't you think

28:26.510 --> 28:27.910
you've gone a bit too far?

28:27.920 --> 28:29.350
One minute you're confessing

28:29.350 --> 28:30.030
to me.

28:30.110 --> 28:31.070
Even if you'll end up in jail,

28:31.070 --> 28:32.470
you still want me with you today.

28:32.470 --> 28:33.200
The next minute, you're here

28:33.200 --> 28:33.920
worshiping other women,

28:33.920 --> 28:35.110
unable to tear your eyes away.

28:35.110 --> 28:36.370
What do you take me for?

28:39.240 --> 28:39.880
Wait...

28:40.590 --> 28:42.400
Who is this jealous woman?

28:43.440 --> 28:44.190
Jealous woman!

28:44.190 --> 28:45.270
Who are you calling that?

28:45.270 --> 28:47.070
Who gave you the right to butt in?

28:47.850 --> 28:48.470
Sir,

28:48.680 --> 28:49.480
why didn't you

28:49.790 --> 28:51.480
teach your wife some manners?

28:51.870 --> 28:53.150
Yeah!

28:53.550 --> 28:55.160
You really should discipline her!

28:55.160 --> 28:56.200
Who's his wife?

28:56.220 --> 28:57.070
Keep talking nonsense

28:57.070 --> 28:58.730
and I'll knock your teeth out!

28:59.030 --> 28:59.910
Who are you talking to?

28:59.910 --> 29:00.970
I'm talking to you!

29:01.070 --> 29:01.800
So stubborn.

29:02.220 --> 29:02.750
Let's go.

29:02.780 --> 29:03.100
Go.

29:03.140 --> 29:04.140
Come and fight me!

29:04.550 --> 29:05.180
Come on, let's go.

29:05.180 --> 29:06.580
Let's continue to drink.

29:10.860 --> 29:12.160
What are you laughing at?

29:12.160 --> 29:12.790
Nothing.

29:18.070 --> 29:18.620
Alright,

29:19.000 --> 29:19.730
don't be mad.

29:20.830 --> 29:21.550
I came here

29:21.800 --> 29:22.960
not for the dancers.

29:23.880 --> 29:24.920
I have my own reason

29:24.920 --> 29:25.830
for being here.

29:28.270 --> 29:29.110
What reason?

29:31.140 --> 29:33.000
You won't buy it even if I tell you.

29:33.000 --> 29:33.720
Anyway,

29:33.790 --> 29:34.750
we only have this one day

29:34.750 --> 29:35.720
to be together.

29:36.510 --> 29:38.630
Please bear with it a little.

29:39.200 --> 29:40.440
After tonight,

29:40.800 --> 29:42.920
everything will be back to how it used to be,

29:42.920 --> 29:45.120
and you'll completely forget about me.

29:46.720 --> 29:47.880
Given your impressive capacity,

29:47.880 --> 29:49.680
how could I possibly forget you?

29:52.680 --> 29:55.160
Bravo!

30:00.030 --> 30:01.160
Y-You enjoy the meal first.

30:01.160 --> 30:02.620
I need to use the restroom.

30:02.720 --> 30:03.720
You haven't eaten anything!

30:03.720 --> 30:05.180
Why do you need to use that?

30:08.070 --> 30:08.790
Miss Shen?

30:10.200 --> 30:11.000
Miss Shen.

30:11.400 --> 30:12.160
Miss Shen,

30:12.160 --> 30:14.070
your dance today was stunning.

30:14.270 --> 30:15.480
Sir, you're not supposed to be here.

30:15.480 --> 30:16.030
Please get out.

30:16.030 --> 30:16.680
Miss Shen,

30:17.400 --> 30:19.930
I, Sun, have been admiring you since long ago.

30:20.640 --> 30:21.770
Have a drink with me.

30:22.270 --> 30:22.880
Let go!

30:23.070 --> 30:24.130
Just drink with me!

30:24.160 --> 30:25.420
Why are you still here?

30:26.110 --> 30:27.640
Your friends have all left.

30:28.160 --> 30:30.020
It's you again? I...

30:30.270 --> 30:31.350
It's me, so what?

30:32.430 --> 30:32.830
I...

30:33.720 --> 30:34.350
Miss Shen,

30:34.680 --> 30:35.940
you should be careful.

30:36.000 --> 30:37.350
If you flirt with him,

30:37.830 --> 30:39.110
his ferocious wife

30:39.160 --> 30:40.640
might scratch your face!

30:48.200 --> 30:49.830
Thank you for helping me, sir.

30:49.830 --> 30:50.760
Are you alright?

30:52.960 --> 30:53.690
Are you okay?

31:01.480 --> 31:02.050
Banxia.

31:03.550 --> 31:04.010
Banxia!

31:04.790 --> 31:05.250
Banxia.

31:07.070 --> 31:07.590
Banxia.

31:07.920 --> 31:08.830
Who is Banxia?

31:09.720 --> 31:10.440
Fine, fine.

31:10.790 --> 31:11.550
He Quelian,

31:11.930 --> 31:12.520
Miss He,

31:13.160 --> 31:14.160
listen to me.

31:24.960 --> 31:25.890
Are you alright?

31:28.110 --> 31:29.040
Did you get hurt?

31:37.200 --> 31:38.960
Did you enjoy our shadow puppetry?

31:38.960 --> 31:40.110
Yes! It was amazing!

31:40.440 --> 31:41.160
It was nice!

31:43.270 --> 31:44.530
Are you still mad at me?

31:48.030 --> 31:48.550
It really wasn't

31:48.550 --> 31:49.750
what you saw.

31:51.160 --> 31:52.020
But I know you won't

31:52.020 --> 31:53.420
believe my explanation.

31:58.310 --> 31:59.030
You said you'd go back

31:59.030 --> 32:00.200
with me to explain everything.

32:00.200 --> 32:01.460
Does that still count?

32:02.830 --> 32:03.830
Of course it does.

32:04.510 --> 32:05.550
I won't help you

32:05.660 --> 32:06.720
or speak up for you.

32:08.480 --> 32:09.030
I know.

32:11.920 --> 32:13.590
You'll definitely be harshly punished

32:13.590 --> 32:14.400
and caned.

32:14.400 --> 32:15.440
You might even

32:15.510 --> 32:16.440
be put in jail.

32:17.830 --> 32:18.550
I know.

32:19.240 --> 32:20.880
Are you out of your mind?

32:21.790 --> 32:23.210
Do you know that after today,

32:23.210 --> 32:24.440
I will get married!

32:24.720 --> 32:25.400
Even if Huang

32:25.400 --> 32:26.680
resents me because of this

32:26.680 --> 32:27.800
and refuses to marry me,

32:27.800 --> 32:28.440
my father will still

32:28.440 --> 32:30.040
marry me off to someone else.

32:32.200 --> 32:33.730
Who will he marry you off to?

32:36.070 --> 32:37.800
T-There are plenty of choices!

32:38.240 --> 32:40.300
It could be the son of a rich merchant,

32:40.350 --> 32:42.070
a senior disciple from our martial arts school,

32:42.070 --> 32:42.830
or those

32:43.120 --> 32:44.750
scholars with bright futures.

32:44.750 --> 32:46.410
But it definitely won't be...

32:48.350 --> 32:49.590
It won't be a bearer.

32:50.400 --> 32:51.200
It won't be me.

32:57.480 --> 32:58.280
That's right.

32:59.410 --> 33:00.440
In no case will my father

33:00.440 --> 33:02.240
consider you good enough for me.

33:02.400 --> 33:04.210
He definitely won't let me marry you.

33:04.210 --> 33:05.940
You should give up on that idea.

33:08.720 --> 33:09.250
Alright.

33:22.240 --> 33:23.480
Sir, are these pears sweet?

33:23.480 --> 33:25.540
Sure! They're sweet, crisp, and red.

33:25.790 --> 33:26.790
Shall we buy some?

33:28.720 --> 33:29.400
Stop there!

33:33.680 --> 33:34.880
I've changed my mind.

33:36.110 --> 33:38.440
I don't need you to go back with me anymore.

33:38.960 --> 33:39.720
You

33:39.790 --> 33:41.650
have neither martial arts skills

33:41.750 --> 33:43.750
nor a prominent family background.

33:45.880 --> 33:47.110
Being snatched away by someone like you

33:47.110 --> 33:48.200
is a disgrace to me!

33:51.270 --> 33:52.550
Get out of Guangping right now.

33:52.550 --> 33:53.070
Don't show up

33:53.070 --> 33:54.470
in front of me ever again!

33:56.570 --> 33:58.170
You can go wherever you want,

33:58.690 --> 34:00.130
find a suitable person,

34:00.160 --> 34:01.070
and marry her.

34:01.510 --> 34:02.920
Don't aim too high again.

34:03.000 --> 34:04.400
No more flights of fancy.

34:04.440 --> 34:04.960
Don't do

34:04.960 --> 34:05.960
anything that leads nowhere,

34:05.960 --> 34:06.640
confusing

34:06.640 --> 34:07.640
or troubling others.

34:07.640 --> 34:08.440
Do you hear me?

34:11.030 --> 34:14.030
Then what do you call something that leads somewhere?

34:14.280 --> 34:16.060
Love involves two people.

34:17.230 --> 34:18.150
You like her,

34:18.150 --> 34:19.510
and she can respond to your feelings.

34:19.510 --> 34:21.770
That's something that leads somewhere.

34:26.400 --> 34:28.000
When the sun rises tomorrow,

34:28.960 --> 34:30.889
you'll forget me again, won't you?

34:35.880 --> 34:37.280
Who could forget someone

34:37.480 --> 34:38.540
as annoying as you?

34:40.480 --> 34:41.739
You don't understand.

34:42.960 --> 34:43.889
Everything here

34:44.280 --> 34:45.440
is like a dream.

34:46.280 --> 34:48.080
None will remain when it's over.

34:49.590 --> 34:50.670
If I tell you

34:52.440 --> 34:54.570
we've known each other for a long time,

34:55.110 --> 34:56.239
will you believe me?

34:59.480 --> 35:01.000
But I don't remember you.

35:03.470 --> 35:05.000
You don't need to remember.

35:05.550 --> 35:06.750
So long as I remember.

35:07.680 --> 35:11.210
♫Melody echoes along the river; wild geese soar in sudden fright♫

35:11.690 --> 35:14.370
♫The music ends, and I stand in solitude♫

35:16.010 --> 35:19.240
♫I see you turn into a handful of starlight♫

35:19.150 --> 35:19.840
Actually,

35:19.720 --> 35:23.550
♫Drifting past me♫

35:21.230 --> 35:22.540
I do really like you.

35:24.010 --> 35:27.800
♫In tears, the past memories still glow♫

35:25.710 --> 35:26.400
But I don't know

35:26.400 --> 35:27.590
when it started.

35:28.160 --> 35:31.300
♫Crystallized into cold amber♫

35:29.150 --> 35:29.670
Perhaps

35:30.630 --> 35:31.840
my love began a long time ago.

35:31.460 --> 35:36.050
♫I know it also brought you great pain to let go♫

35:35.360 --> 35:36.840
I didn't respond to you

35:36.440 --> 35:38.450
♫But why did you♫

35:38.630 --> 35:39.480
because I saw no possibility

35:38.760 --> 35:43.050
♫Still endure the pain and shatter♫

35:39.480 --> 35:40.140
between us.

35:42.800 --> 35:44.800
I'm a demon hunter who makes a living

35:43.390 --> 35:47.880
♫Remember me, don't miss me♫

35:45.190 --> 35:47.230
in a world of bloodshed and violence.

35:47.230 --> 35:48.070
But you're different.

35:47.980 --> 35:51.660
♫Don't put the blame on yourself for my solitude♫

35:48.800 --> 35:51.060
You have your originally peaceful life,

35:51.800 --> 35:53.110
parents who love you,

35:51.940 --> 35:53.880
♫I hate that I failed♫

35:53.910 --> 35:59.230
♫To catch the glistening starlight♫

35:54.150 --> 35:55.680
and a perfect match for you.

35:57.830 --> 35:58.890
Because of demons,

35:59.550 --> 36:00.070
your life

35:59.600 --> 36:03.800
♫We were meant to miss each other in this life♫

36:00.070 --> 36:01.280
deviated a bit.

36:01.880 --> 36:03.010
So you accidentally

36:03.400 --> 36:04.440
crossed paths with me.

36:03.830 --> 36:08.690
♫Only after missing did we learn how much love could hurt♫

36:05.920 --> 36:06.510
And I

36:07.320 --> 36:09.460
should help you correct these deviations

36:09.460 --> 36:15.640
♫To have loved you is to have truly lived♫

36:10.000 --> 36:10.710
and send you back

36:10.710 --> 36:12.710
to the path you're supposed to take.

36:14.590 --> 36:15.440
So honestly,

36:16.670 --> 36:18.930
I'm not supposed to fall in love with you.

36:19.290 --> 36:20.820
What are you talking about?

36:21.510 --> 36:22.640
I don't understand.

36:24.800 --> 36:25.860
It doesn't matter.

36:26.830 --> 36:28.160
Even if you understood,

36:29.320 --> 36:31.720
you would forget about it tomorrow anyway.

36:32.260 --> 36:36.450
♫Remember me, don't miss me♫

36:36.670 --> 36:40.550
♫Don't put the blame on yourself for my solitude♫

36:40.840 --> 36:42.760
♫I hate that I failed♫

36:42.790 --> 36:48.160
♫To catch the glistening starlight♫

36:48.500 --> 36:52.940
♫We were meant to miss each other in this life♫

36:52.970 --> 36:57.680
♫Only after missing did we learn how much love could hurt♫

36:53.230 --> 36:54.690
What a beautiful evening,

36:56.000 --> 36:57.730
but it's a pity there's no moon.

36:58.220 --> 37:04.260
♫To have loved you is to have truly lived♫

36:59.830 --> 37:00.540
Moon...

37:11.800 --> 37:12.530
Big Brother,

37:12.640 --> 37:13.460
are you hurt?

37:14.440 --> 37:15.440
What are you waiting for?

37:15.440 --> 37:17.120
Help Big Brother up.

37:17.840 --> 37:18.590
It's okay.

37:20.190 --> 37:21.390
I'm your Big Brother.

37:21.460 --> 37:22.680
Will you listen to me?

37:23.190 --> 37:23.510
Yes.

37:23.770 --> 37:24.230
We will.

37:28.230 --> 37:28.710
Congratulations, My Lord!

37:28.710 --> 37:30.440
Thank you, thank you all.

37:31.880 --> 37:32.510
Congratulations.

37:32.510 --> 37:32.960
Thank you, thank you.

37:32.960 --> 37:33.800
Congratulations!

37:33.800 --> 37:34.510
Thank you.

37:34.920 --> 37:36.110
Thank you, guys.

37:37.000 --> 37:38.330
Come and join the feast.

37:38.710 --> 37:39.910
Thank you, thank you.

37:41.000 --> 37:41.730
Big Brother,

37:42.360 --> 37:44.320
this is my first time snatching a bride.

37:44.320 --> 37:45.840
I'm kind of nervous.

37:46.030 --> 37:47.530
We used to escort brides.

37:47.550 --> 37:48.960
Today we're snatching one.

37:48.960 --> 37:50.620
We've never done this before.

37:51.230 --> 37:52.570
I-It's also my first time.

37:52.570 --> 37:56.260
I-I'm quite nervous as well.

37:57.710 --> 37:58.440
Don't panic.

37:59.190 --> 38:00.850
Just follow my instructions.

38:01.110 --> 38:01.480
Okay.

38:02.110 --> 38:02.510
Got it.

38:03.280 --> 38:03.960
Congratulations.

38:03.960 --> 38:04.590
Congratulations.

38:04.590 --> 38:05.110
Congratulations.

38:05.110 --> 38:05.840
Congratulations, Lord Huang.

38:05.840 --> 38:06.710
Congratulations, Lord Huang.

38:06.710 --> 38:07.770
Congratulations.

38:07.880 --> 38:08.940
Congratulations.

38:11.800 --> 38:12.400
Xuanye!

38:13.590 --> 38:14.190
Xuanye!

38:18.230 --> 38:19.030
Ermao, Ermao.

38:19.230 --> 38:20.130
I need to answer the call of nature.

38:20.130 --> 38:21.260
Hang in there, okay?

38:22.360 --> 38:23.800
Big Brother, Big Brother!

38:23.800 --> 38:24.070
I...

38:25.230 --> 38:25.960
Big Brother!

38:29.590 --> 38:30.110
Banxia.

38:31.800 --> 38:32.280
Banxia.

38:32.900 --> 38:33.590
I'm here.

38:36.190 --> 38:37.190
You remember now?

38:40.150 --> 38:41.000
Come with me.

38:47.360 --> 38:49.090
How did you regain your memory?

38:51.190 --> 38:52.320
I'm not sure either.

38:52.510 --> 38:54.710
I just recalled everything when I woke up today.

38:54.710 --> 38:55.960
How did you find me?

38:56.960 --> 38:58.550
I followed the clues you left behind

38:58.550 --> 39:00.580
and tracked you to the Enlightenment Bookstore.

39:00.580 --> 39:01.670
That bookstore owner

39:01.670 --> 39:02.870
is indeed something.

39:03.480 --> 39:04.510
When I was fighting him,

39:04.510 --> 39:05.280
I accidentally fell into

39:05.280 --> 39:06.710
"A Spring Day in Guangping."

39:06.710 --> 39:07.590
After that,

39:07.890 --> 39:08.480
I saw

39:08.480 --> 39:10.810
you and Youhuang, both without memories.

39:11.670 --> 39:12.710
It's not just us.

39:13.030 --> 39:14.110
There must be many more

39:14.110 --> 39:15.970
people trapped in this painting.

39:17.510 --> 39:18.190
Perhaps

39:18.630 --> 39:19.420
your parents

39:19.760 --> 39:21.560
are also stuck in this painting.

39:21.880 --> 39:22.880
You have a lead?

39:24.360 --> 39:25.840
In "A Spring Day in Guangping",

39:25.840 --> 39:27.800
there are six famous Guangping spots depicted,

39:27.800 --> 39:29.630
known as the Six Wonders of Guangping.

39:29.630 --> 39:29.960
Yesterday,

39:29.960 --> 39:31.820
we already visited three of them.

39:32.110 --> 39:33.500
As for the keeper of the Shinan Tower,

39:33.500 --> 39:34.510
the owner of Tang Garden,

39:34.510 --> 39:35.590
and the Sogdian Whirl dancer,

39:35.590 --> 39:36.790
I've tested them all.

39:36.920 --> 39:37.960
Just like us, they're

39:37.960 --> 39:40.020
all humans who entered the painting.

39:40.030 --> 39:40.410
But

39:40.430 --> 39:42.060
how can you tell who's from the real world

39:42.060 --> 39:43.660
and who's from the painting?

39:51.940 --> 39:52.510
Look.

39:54.760 --> 39:56.000
That's ink?

39:56.400 --> 39:57.780
The blood of those from the real world

39:57.780 --> 39:58.800
is all red,

39:59.110 --> 40:00.440
but when the others are injured,

40:00.440 --> 40:01.110
the blood they shed,

40:01.110 --> 40:01.710
just like these

40:01.710 --> 40:02.860
completely destroyed things,

40:02.860 --> 40:04.120
will all turn into ink.

40:07.880 --> 40:09.840
But Guangping City is so huge,

40:10.280 --> 40:12.240
inhabited by thousands of people.

40:12.400 --> 40:14.930
We can't possibly test them one by one, can we?

40:14.960 --> 40:15.760
The painter

40:15.760 --> 40:17.510
doesn't randomly capture anyone in sight

40:17.510 --> 40:18.310
but seeks

40:18.330 --> 40:19.670
those who match the Six Wonders

40:19.670 --> 40:21.400
and traps them in the painting.

40:22.330 --> 40:22.920
So, does that mean

40:22.920 --> 40:24.280
if we visit all the Six Wonders,

40:24.280 --> 40:26.540
we might have a chance to find my parents?

40:31.110 --> 40:32.640
This dress is such a hassle.

40:32.800 --> 40:33.760
We need to find a place

40:33.760 --> 40:35.020
and let me get changed.

40:40.880 --> 40:41.550
Well, well.

40:41.570 --> 40:42.880
There you are, as expected!

40:42.880 --> 40:43.880
Let her go now!

40:45.510 --> 40:46.230
Calm down.

40:46.230 --> 40:47.320
Don't hurt him.

40:47.630 --> 40:48.290
He Quelian,

40:48.920 --> 40:51.120
I can't believe you're protecting him.

41:01.440 --> 41:02.770
Why are you helping him?

41:04.800 --> 41:06.270
Tell me why!

41:07.730 --> 41:09.730
What exactly is your relationship?

41:10.110 --> 41:11.040
Wit, Youhuang,

41:11.080 --> 41:12.290
let me explain.

41:12.310 --> 41:14.240
This is a rather complicated case.

41:14.320 --> 41:15.230
Well, let's sit down

41:15.230 --> 41:16.280
and talk it over.

41:17.400 --> 41:18.150
He Quelian,

41:19.390 --> 41:21.630
you even ran away from your wedding for him.

41:21.630 --> 41:23.430
What else is there to talk about?

41:26.440 --> 41:27.880
I'll kill him right now.

41:37.820 --> 41:38.400
Big Brother,

41:38.400 --> 41:40.440
are you... Are you alright?

41:52.440 --> 41:52.840
Why is

41:52.860 --> 41:54.590
Youhuang also in the painting?

41:56.110 --> 41:56.840
Maybe

41:56.840 --> 41:58.230
he came to investigate a case

41:58.230 --> 41:59.890
and ended up here by accident.

42:01.230 --> 42:02.510
Is it possible that he's also

42:02.510 --> 42:04.040
a figure from the painting?

42:09.240 --> 42:10.440
We could prick him with a needle

42:10.440 --> 42:11.110
to find out.

42:13.110 --> 42:13.710
You...

42:20.110 --> 42:20.840
He Quelian.

42:23.260 --> 42:24.790
As childhood sweethearts,

42:25.110 --> 42:27.370
we've known each other for over a decade.

42:27.540 --> 42:29.140
Now for a useless pretty boy,

42:29.150 --> 42:30.960
you actually want to hurt me?

42:31.510 --> 42:32.880
What's your conscience?

42:32.880 --> 42:35.030
I really misjudged you!

42:37.920 --> 42:39.050
Useless pretty boy?

42:40.200 --> 42:40.800
No need to test.

42:40.800 --> 42:41.360
Being this stubborn,

42:41.360 --> 42:42.490
he must be Youhuang.

42:42.760 --> 42:43.260
Well,

42:43.920 --> 42:44.840
look at him now.

42:44.860 --> 42:46.250
Is there any way

42:46.280 --> 42:47.160
to wake him up?

42:48.440 --> 42:50.400
I've tried almost everything I could think of

42:50.400 --> 42:51.060
but failed.

42:51.710 --> 42:52.510
Then what now?

42:52.710 --> 42:54.370
Just leave him here like this?

43:00.150 --> 43:00.950
I have an idea.

43:06.940 --> 43:08.070
Let's knock him out.

43:08.760 --> 43:09.710
That way, he won't sabotage

43:09.710 --> 43:10.840
our plans, right?

43:13.190 --> 43:14.430
You're going too far!

43:15.070 --> 43:16.130
You're discussing

43:16.620 --> 43:17.690
so loudly and aboveboard

43:17.690 --> 43:19.090
how to do bad things to me?

43:19.840 --> 43:22.370
I-If I break free,

43:23.610 --> 43:25.860
I certainly won't let you off.

43:29.480 --> 43:33.070
Down on my luck, and everyone can mess with me...

43:36.890 --> 43:37.420
How about

43:37.440 --> 43:38.480
we reason with him

43:38.500 --> 43:39.830
properly?

43:41.630 --> 43:42.560
Reason with him?

43:43.710 --> 43:44.970
Well, you give it a try.

43:47.510 --> 43:48.390
Listen.

43:49.000 --> 43:49.680
You

43:49.840 --> 43:52.110
are not the Young Master of Huang Residence.

43:52.110 --> 43:54.360
Your name is Chu Youhuang.

43:54.630 --> 43:56.090
You're one of our friends.

44:03.070 --> 44:04.600
So what we need to do now

44:04.630 --> 44:06.890
is to escape from the painting together.

44:06.920 --> 44:07.980
Do you understand?

44:09.440 --> 44:10.360
That's all?

44:14.960 --> 44:15.630
If you want to kill

44:15.630 --> 44:17.230
or torture me, just do it now.

44:17.540 --> 44:18.860
Since you dared to have an affair with him,

44:18.860 --> 44:20.400
bringing disgrace to my family,

44:20.400 --> 44:21.030
why did you make up

44:21.030 --> 44:22.510
such a story to deceive me?

44:23.800 --> 44:24.910
A fickle woman

44:25.150 --> 44:26.420
and a despicable man,

44:26.560 --> 44:28.200
you two are a perfect match!

44:28.230 --> 44:28.980
You disgusting couple!

44:28.980 --> 44:30.060
How shameless!

44:30.320 --> 44:31.900
You vicious bitch!

44:32.090 --> 44:33.690
You'll get what you deserve!

44:37.110 --> 44:38.000
You're right.

44:38.050 --> 44:38.760
We should just

44:38.760 --> 44:40.000
leave this stubborn fool here.
